### AI掘金头条 用户模块 API
### 前提：uvicorn main:app --reload

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

# 保存登录后返回的 Token（手动替换下面的值）
@authToken = <token>


# ═══ 用户注册 ═══════════════════════════

### POST /api/user/register — 正常注册
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 200: {code:200, message:"注册成功", data:{token:"...", user_info:{...}}}

### POST /api/user/register — 重复用户名 → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "654321"
}

### POST /api/user/register — 密码太短 < 6 → 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newuser",
  "password": "123"
}


# ═══ 用户登录 ═══════════════════════════

### POST /api/user/login — 正常登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "123456"
}
# 200: {code:200, message:"登录成功", data:{token:"...", user_info:{...}}}
# 复制返回的 token 到上面 @authToken 变量

### POST /api/user/login — 密码错误 → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "wrongpw"
}


# ═══ 获取用户信息（需 Token）═══════════

### GET /api/user/info — 获取当前用户信息
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user/info
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
# 200: 返回用户详细信息

### GET /api/user/info — 无 Token → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user/info
# 401: 请先登录


# ═══ 修改用户信息（需 Token）═══════════

### PUT /api/user/update — 修改昵称和简介
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/user/update
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "nickname": "测试用户",
  "bio": "这是我的简介"
}

### PUT /api/user/update — 传入空对象
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/user/update
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{}
# 200: 不变（全部可选）


# ═══ 修改密码（需 Token）═══════════════

### PUT /api/user/password — 正常修改密码
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/user/password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "old_password": "123456",
  "new_password": "654321"
}

### PUT /api/user/password — 旧密码错误 → 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/user/password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "old_password": "wrong",
  "new_password": "654321"
}
